.TH "RAPTOR" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor \- RAPTOR Studio: reliability block diagram simulation. With no command, or just a model file, opens the desktop application.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor\fR [\-h] [\-V] [\-v] [\-q] [\-\-log\-level LEVEL] [\-\-log\-file PATH] [\-\-debug] [\-\-config PATH] [\-\-no\-config] [\-\-color {auto,always,never}] [\-\-dev\-features LIST] COMMAND ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
RAPTOR Studio: reliability block diagram simulation. With no command, or just a model file, opens the desktop application.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Global options
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
show program's version number and exit
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
more detail on stderr (repeat: \-vv)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
errors only
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-level\fR \fILEVEL\fR
debug|info|warning|error (default warning)
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-file\fR \fIPATH\fR
also write the log to PATH
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
debug tracing and a native\-crash backtrace (same as RAPTOR_DEBUG=1)
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fIPATH\fR
settings file (default $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/raptor\-studio/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-config\fR
ignore the settings file and RAPTOR_* defaults
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI{auto|always|never}\fR
colour output (honours NO_COLOR)
.TP
\fB\-\-dev\-features\fR \fILIST\fR
enable developer options: comma list, 'all' or 'none' (same as RAPTOR_DEV_FEATURES)
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Open the desktop application.
.RS
.nf
\fBraptor\fR
.fi
.RE
.PP
Open pump.rbd in the desktop application.
.RS
.nf
\fBraptor pump.rbd\fR
.fi
.RE
.PP
Simulate 100 runs and read one number.
.RS
.nf
\fBraptor run pump.rbd \-n 100 \-f json | jq .summary.Availability\fR
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\-gui\fR(1), \fBraptor\-run\fR(1), \fBraptor\-validate\fR(1), \fBraptor\-info\fR(1), \fBraptor\-get\fR(1), \fBraptor\-set\fR(1), \fBraptor\-config\fR(5)
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
\fB0\fR
success
.TP
\fB1\fR
runtime error
.TP
\fB2\fR
usage error
.TP
\fB3\fR
model invalid (validation errors)
.TP
\fB4\fR
model refused: a shape Raptor 7 cannot run
.TP
\fB5\fR
timed out or aborted; partial results written
.TP
\fB6\fR
output could not be written
.TP
\fB130\fR
interrupted (Ctrl\-C); partial results written
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBRAPTOR_DEBUG\fR
same as \-\-debug
.TP
\fBRAPTOR_DEV_FEATURES\fR
same as \-\-dev\-features
.TP
\fBRAPTOR_CONFIG\fR
path of the settings file (same as \-\-config)
.TP
\fBRAPTOR_WORKSPACE\fR
default for \-\-workspace
.TP
\fBRAPTOR_SEED\fR
salt for every random stream (same as \-\-seed)
.TP
\fBNO_COLOR\fR
disable colour output
.TP
\fBXDG_CONFIG_HOME, XDG_DATA_HOME\fR
base directories
.SH FILES
.TP
\fB$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/raptor\-studio/config.toml\fR
settings file (see raptor\-config(5))
.TP
\fB$XDG_DATA_HOME/raptor\-studio/mcp\fR
default MCP server workspace
